Notes
-----
* SonarQube Community Build has no C/C++ analyser of its own. This sandbox uses
  the community plugin sonar-cxx, which imports cppcheck, clang-tidy and
  Valgrind reports. The repository's tools\scan-sonar.ps1 and its build
  wrapper are for the commercial C/C++ analyser and do not apply here.
* SonarQube first login: admin / admin, then set a throwaway password.
* GCC-win64 on SC1 compiles portable C/C++ - not this application, which
  needs POSIX headers.
* Environment check of SC1:
    powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File {{ cr12_lab_dir_win }}\verify-cr-env.ps1

